    AmplifyShaderEditor, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null;443;2672,5920;Inherit;False;212;278;Alpha;1;502;;0,0,0,1;0;0\nNode;AmplifyShaderEditor.CommentaryNode,
